        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, door, outer, aluminium, opaque filling, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, door, outer, aluminium, opaque filling, to final disposal
The amount of materials to be disposed of at the end of life was estimated based on the bill of materials. A cut-off approach is used for recycling of metals.;
UUID: 7a286c7c-383d-4f5a-ba1f-7e2f0549294b
Included are the disposal of waste materials from outer aluminium doors with opaque filling. The transport of the disposed materials is also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Bill of materials. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7a286c7c-383d-4f5a-ba1f-7e2f0549294b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
